    <string name="help_coyote">Coyote not found or won\'t connect? Close the DG-Lab app, then power-cycle the box: turn it OFF, turn it ON, and turn the A and B wheels in opposite directions until the wolf eye blinks 5 times — that is pairing mode. Then SCAN.</string>
    <string name="help_opossum">Opossum not found? Press its power button 5 times until the Bluetooth icon turns yellow, then SCAN.</string>

